"The crow was ardent\nThe caws were different \nUnlike the bygone \nIt was a baritone\n\nNot a snatched vocal \nBut something original \nNot primodial\nBut something within the vocal\n\nThe crow still fly\nNot truely an apex \nThe eggs of cuckoo \nStill diligent and counters the hex\n\nThe crow got jokes\nThe gaslighting was real\nThe crow still caws\nAnd it seems unreal"